* {{audio|Hu-ég.ogg|Audio|lang=hu}}
* {{hyphenation|ég|lang=hu}}

===Etymology 1===
Probably from {{inh|hu|fiu-pro|*säŋe||air}}. Possible cognates are limited to Baltic-Finnic (e.g. {{cog|fi|sää||weather}}) and {{cog|koi|сынӧд||warm air}}.

====Noun====
{{hu-noun|pl=egek}}

# [[sky]]

=====Declension=====
{{hu-infl-nom|ege|e|stem2=ég}}{{hu-pos-etek|eg||ei}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|hu|égbolt}}

=====Derived terms=====
